#. [campaign]: id=Star_Wars_Thrawn_Trilogy_Dark_Force_Rising
#: _main.cfg:70
msgid ""
"Leia seeks the truth about the Noghri on their ruined homeworld. Luke meets the unstable Jedi Master Joruus C'baoth. Han and Lando search for a lost fleet of two hundred Dreadnaughts, and so does Grand Admiral Thrawn.\n"
"\n"
"Campaign II of an original, fan-made Thrawn Trilogy total conversion. Ten missions."
msgstr ""

