msgid "New Republic Perimeter Guard Squad"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_nr_perimeter_guard_squad, race=human
#: units/infantry.cfg:949
msgid "A durable line-defense squad trained to hold fortified positions and repel close-quarters assaults. Equipped with a precision blaster rifle for disciplined close-range fire and a reinforced shock baton for melee engagement, the Perimeter Guard Squad anchors the defensive line. Their sturdy armor and steady discipline make them exceptionally difficult to dislodge once positioned."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: units/infantry.cfg:976
msgid "shock baton"
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/infantry.cfg:999
msgid "Cover bonus from flat terrain: the Perimeter Guard Squad's reinforced defensive line provides additional protection across open ground."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_nr_pathfinder_squad, race=human
#: units/infantry.cfg:1013
msgid "New Republic Pathfinder Squad"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_nr_pathfinder_squad, race=human
#: units/infantry.cfg:1014
msgid "A veteran scouting and objective-designation squad trained to lead advance parties and mark priority targets for heavier units. Equipped with a precision blaster rifle and a survival knife, the Pathfinder operates ahead of the main force, calling in coordinates and identifying enemy weak points. Their low armor and moderate hitpoints make them vulnerable in prolonged engagements, but their speed and target-designation role make them invaluable for directing the battle."
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/infantry.cfg:1064
msgid "Cover bonus from forest terrain: the Pathfinder Squad's camouflage and scouting training provide additional protection among trees."
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/infantry.cfg:1069
msgid "Cover bonus from rough terrain: the Pathfinder Squad's field awareness and mobility gain stability on uneven ground."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_nr_field_engineer_team, race=human
#: units/infantry.cfg:1085
msgid "New Republic Field Engineer Team"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_nr_field_engineer_team, race=human
#: units/infantry.cfg:1086
msgid "A versatile support squad specializing in field repair and signal restoration. Equipped with a short-range blaster for defensive fire and portable repair and signaling equipment, the Field Engineer Team restores damaged vehicles and re-establishes communications across the battlefield. Their modest armor and short-range blaster make them effective defenders of key positions, while their repair tools allow them to sustain allied formations in contested areas."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: units/infantry.cfg:1103
#: units/vehicles.cfg:88
msgid "defensive blaster"
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=pierce
#: units/infantry.cfg:1113
msgid "repair and signal tool"
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/infantry.cfg:1136
msgid "Cover bonus from forest terrain: the Field Engineer Team's portable equipment and overhead cover provide additional protection among trees."
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/infantry.cfg:1141
msgid "Cover bonus from rough terrain: the Field Engineer Team's stabilized equipment gains protection on uneven ground."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_nr_starwing_escape, race=human
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:14
msgid "New Republic Starwing Escort"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_nr_starwing_escape, race=human
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:15
msgid "A nimble New Republic escort craft tasked with protecting convoys and capital ships. Armed with twin laser cannons and shielding technology, it weaves through danger zones to shield allied transports and engage enemy fighters before they reach their targets."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:30
msgid "dual laser cannons"
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:65
msgid "Open terrain bonus: the Escort's agile thrusters perform best on open ground, maintaining maneuverability and clear firing lines."
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:70
msgid "Rough terrain bonus: the Escort's repulsor lift absorbs shock on uneven terrain, maintaining stable weapon platforms."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_im_venator_interceptor, race=human
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:81
msgid "Imperial Remnant Interceptor Squadron"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_im_venator_interceptor, race=human
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:82
msgid "A squadron of Imperial Remnant interceptors that spearhead hit-and-run strikes against enemy formations. Built for speed and devastating precision, these vessels dive into vulnerable targets with concentrated laser fire and rip them apart before reinforcements can arrive."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:97
msgid "lightning lasers"
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=impact
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:107
msgid "ion burst"
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:132
