#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_im_torpedo_bomber_squadron, race=human
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:149
msgid "Imperial Remnant Torpedo Bomber Squadron"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_im_torpedo_bomber_squadron, race=human
#: units/spacecraft.cfg:150
msgid "A squadron of Imperial Remnant torpedo bombers built for slow, devastating heavy-strike missions against capital ships and fortified positions. Carrying bulky proton torpedo banks and protected by thick hull plating, these vessels advance into range under fighter cover and unleash concentrated bombing runs that shred even the toughest enemy hulls before retreating to safety."
